{
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "slug": "map",
  "title": "Map",
  "group": "Data display",
  "order": 23.5,
  "summary": {
    "en": "A small slippy map over OpenStreetMap tiles: routes with the travelled part in the accent, the vehicle where it is, and pins for the places that matter. It draws only the tiles in view and always credits the map data in the corner.",
    "id": "Peta geser kecil di atas tile OpenStreetMap: rute dengan bagian yang sudah ditempuh berwarna aksen, kendaraan di posisinya, dan pin untuk tempat yang penting. Hanya menggambar tile yang terlihat dan selalu mencantumkan kredit data peta di sudut."
  },
  "titleId": "Map",
  "react": false,
  "examples": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "A flight under way",
        "desc": "The leg follows the great circle, bowed gently so it reads as a flight. The travelled part draws in on first view, then the plane settles, turned along its path. Drag, scroll, pinch or use the buttons; focus the map and use the arrow keys and plus or minus.",
        "html": "<div class=\"map\" style=\"--map-h: 340px;\" data-lds-map='{\"label\":\"Air freight from Jakarta to Singapore, 65 percent of the way\",\"routes\":[{\"path\":[[-6.1256,106.6559],[1.3644,103.9915]],\"progress\":0.65,\"arc\":true,\"vehicle\":{\"icon\":\"flight\",\"label\":\"Flight 884\",\"sub\":\"Lands 08:45\"}}],\"markers\":[{\"at\":[-6.1256,106.6559],\"kind\":\"origin\",\"label\":\"Jakarta CGK\",\"sub\":\"Left 06:10\"},{\"at\":[1.3644,103.9915],\"kind\":\"destination\",\"label\":\"Singapore SIN\",\"sub\":\"Lands 08:45\"}]}'></div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "A road trip with stops",
        "desc": "A truck route through road waypoints. Passed stops fill, the caret on the truck points the way it is heading, and each place says when in its label.",
        "html": "<div class=\"map\" style=\"--map-h: 360px;\" data-lds-map='{\"label\":\"Road freight from Bandung to Yogyakarta, past Tasikmalaya, next stop Purwokerto\",\"routes\":[{\"path\":[[-6.9175,107.6191],[-6.94,107.75],[-7.03,107.89],[-7.06,108.08],[-7.3274,108.2207],[-7.33,108.35],[-7.37,108.54],[-7.3,108.76],[-7.52,109.06],[-7.4245,109.2302],[-7.51,109.29],[-7.61,109.51],[-7.67,109.65],[-7.72,109.91],[-7.71,110.01],[-7.86,110.16],[-7.7956,110.3695]],\"progress\":0.36,\"vehicle\":{\"icon\":\"local_shipping\",\"label\":\"Truck D 8812 KL\",\"sub\":\"Next: Purwokerto 06:30\"}}],\"markers\":[{\"at\":[-6.9175,107.6191],\"kind\":\"origin\",\"label\":\"Bandung\",\"sub\":\"Loaded 15 Nov, 21:00\"},{\"at\":[-7.3274,108.2207],\"kind\":\"stop\",\"done\":true,\"label\":\"Tasikmalaya\",\"sub\":\"Passed 16 Nov, 01:40\"},{\"at\":[-7.4245,109.2302],\"kind\":\"stop\",\"label\":\"Purwokerto\",\"sub\":\"Due 06:30\"},{\"at\":[-7.7956,110.3695],\"kind\":\"destination\",\"label\":\"Yogyakarta\",\"sub\":\"Due 10:15\"}]}'></div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Several places, fitted",
        "desc": "Without routes, the map fits every marker with room for the pins. Inside a scrolling page, `scrollZoom: \"modifier\"` leaves the wheel to the page and zooms only with Ctrl or Cmd held, with a short hint.",
        "html": "<div class=\"map\" style=\"--map-h: 300px; max-width: 560px;\" data-lds-map='{\"label\":\"Exam centres in Bandung\",\"scrollZoom\":\"modifier\",\"markers\":[{\"at\":[-6.8915,107.6107],\"label\":\"Dago centre\",\"sub\":\"120 seats, 2 sessions left\"},{\"at\":[-6.9147,107.6098],\"label\":\"Braga centre\",\"sub\":\"80 seats, full\"},{\"at\":[-6.9389,107.6229],\"label\":\"Buah Batu centre\",\"sub\":\"96 seats, 5 sessions left\"},{\"at\":[-6.8721,107.5841],\"label\":\"Setiabudi centre\",\"sub\":\"60 seats, 1 session left\"},{\"at\":[-6.9447,107.5774],\"label\":\"Kopo centre\",\"sub\":\"140 seats, 8 sessions left\"}]}'></div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Switching records: fly to fit",
        "desc": "Calling `drawMap` again on the same element (or `handle.update`) flies the map out and back in to fit the new route, then draws the travelled part. Any drag or key stops the flight where it is.",
        "html": "<div class=\"docs-col\" style=\"gap: 12px;\"><div class=\"cluster\" style=\"--gap: 8px;\"><button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--sm\" type=\"button\" onclick=\"this.closest('.docs-col').querySelector('.map')._ldsMap.handle.update({&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Air freight from Jakarta to Singapore, 65 percent of the way&quot;,&quot;routes&quot;:[{&quot;path&quot;:[[-6.1256,106.6559],[1.3644,103.9915]],&quot;progress&quot;:0.65,&quot;arc&quot;:true,&quot;vehicle&quot;:{&quot;icon&quot;:&quot;flight&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Flight 884&quot;,&quot;sub&quot;:&quot;Lands 08:45&quot;}}],&quot;markers&quot;:[{&quot;at&quot;:[-6.1256,106.6559],&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;origin&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Jakarta CGK&quot;,&quot;sub&quot;:&quot;Left 06:10&quot;},{&quot;at&quot;:[1.3644,103.9915],&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;destination&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Singapore SIN&quot;,&quot;sub&quot;:&quot;Lands 08:45&quot;}]})\">Jakarta to Singapore</button><button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--sm\" type=\"button\" onclick=\"this.closest('.docs-col').querySelector('.map')._ldsMap.handle.update({&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Road freight from Bandung to Yogyakarta, past Tasikmalaya, next stop Purwokerto&quot;,&quot;routes&quot;:[{&quot;path&quot;:[[-6.9175,107.6191],[-6.94,107.75],[-7.03,107.89],[-7.06,108.08],[-7.3274,108.2207],[-7.33,108.35],[-7.37,108.54],[-7.3,108.76],[-7.52,109.06],[-7.4245,109.2302],[-7.51,109.29],[-7.61,109.51],[-7.67,109.65],[-7.72,109.91],[-7.71,110.01],[-7.86,110.16],[-7.7956,110.3695]],&quot;progress&quot;:0.36,&quot;vehicle&quot;:{&quot;icon&quot;:&quot;local_shipping&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Truck D 8812 KL&quot;,&quot;sub&quot;:&quot;Next: Purwokerto 06:30&quot;}}],&quot;markers&quot;:[{&quot;at&quot;:[-6.9175,107.6191],&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;origin&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Bandung&quot;,&quot;sub&quot;:&quot;Loaded 15 Nov, 21:00&quot;},{&quot;at&quot;:[-7.3274,108.2207],&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;stop&quot;,&quot;done&quot;:true,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Tasikmalaya&quot;,&quot;sub&quot;:&quot;Passed 16 Nov, 01:40&quot;},{&quot;at&quot;:[-7.4245,109.2302],&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;stop&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Purwokerto&quot;,&quot;sub&quot;:&quot;Due 06:30&quot;},{&quot;at&quot;:[-7.7956,110.3695],&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;destination&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Yogyakarta&quot;,&quot;sub&quot;:&quot;Due 10:15&quot;}]})\">Bandung to Yogyakarta</button></div><div class=\"map\" style=\"--map-h: 320px;\" data-lds-map='{\"label\":\"Air freight from Jakarta to Singapore, 65 percent of the way\",\"routes\":[{\"path\":[[-6.1256,106.6559],[1.3644,103.9915]],\"progress\":0.65,\"arc\":true,\"vehicle\":{\"icon\":\"flight\",\"label\":\"Flight 884\",\"sub\":\"Lands 08:45\"}}],\"markers\":[{\"at\":[-6.1256,106.6559],\"kind\":\"origin\",\"label\":\"Jakarta CGK\",\"sub\":\"Left 06:10\"},{\"at\":[1.3644,103.9915],\"kind\":\"destination\",\"label\":\"Singapore SIN\",\"sub\":\"Lands 08:45\"}]}'></div></div>",
        "code": "<div class=\"map\" style=\"--map-h: 320px;\" data-lds-map='{\"label\":\"Air freight from Jakarta to Singapore\",\"routes\":[{\"path\":[[-6.1256,106.6559],[1.3644,103.9915]],\"progress\":0.65,\"arc\":true,\"vehicle\":{\"icon\":\"flight\",\"label\":\"Flight 884\"}}],\"markers\":[{\"at\":[-6.1256,106.6559],\"kind\":\"origin\",\"label\":\"Jakarta CGK\"},{\"at\":[1.3644,103.9915],\"kind\":\"destination\",\"label\":\"Singapore SIN\"}]}'></div>\n\n<script type=\"module\">\n  import { drawMap } from 'lampung-design-system/js';\n  const map = drawMap(el, config);          // or let init() read data-lds-map\n  list.addEventListener('click', (e) => {\n    const s = shipments[e.target.closest('[data-id]').dataset.id];\n    map.update({ label: s.label, routes: s.routes, markers: s.markers });   // flies to fit\n  });\n  el.addEventListener('lds:mapselect', (e) => openShipment(e.detail.id));   // a marker was clicked\n</script>"
      }
    ],
    "id": [
      {
        "title": "Penerbangan yang sedang berjalan",
        "desc": "Rutenya mengikuti lingkaran besar, dilengkungkan sedikit agar terbaca sebagai penerbangan. Bagian yang sudah ditempuh tergambar saat pertama terlihat, lalu pesawat mengendap, menghadap sepanjang jalurnya. Seret, gulir, cubit, atau pakai tombolnya; fokuskan peta dan pakai tombol panah serta plus atau minus.",
        "html": "<div class=\"map\" style=\"--map-h: 340px;\" data-lds-map='{\"label\":\"Kargo udara dari Jakarta ke Singapura, 65 persen perjalanan\",\"routes\":[{\"path\":[[-6.1256,106.6559],[1.3644,103.9915]],\"progress\":0.65,\"arc\":true,\"vehicle\":{\"icon\":\"flight\",\"label\":\"Penerbangan 884\",\"sub\":\"Mendarat 08.45\"}}],\"markers\":[{\"at\":[-6.1256,106.6559],\"kind\":\"origin\",\"label\":\"Jakarta CGK\",\"sub\":\"Berangkat 06.10\"},{\"at\":[1.3644,103.9915],\"kind\":\"destination\",\"label\":\"Singapura SIN\",\"sub\":\"Mendarat 08.45\"}]}'></div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Perjalanan darat dengan pemberhentian",
        "desc": "Rute truk melewati titik-titik jalan. Pemberhentian yang sudah dilewati terisi, caret pada truk menunjuk arah tujuannya, dan setiap tempat menyebut waktunya di label.",
        "html": "<div class=\"map\" style=\"--map-h: 360px;\" data-lds-map='{\"label\":\"Angkutan darat dari Bandung ke Yogyakarta, sudah melewati Tasikmalaya, pemberhentian berikutnya Purwokerto\",\"routes\":[{\"path\":[[-6.9175,107.6191],[-6.94,107.75],[-7.03,107.89],[-7.06,108.08],[-7.3274,108.2207],[-7.33,108.35],[-7.37,108.54],[-7.3,108.76],[-7.52,109.06],[-7.4245,109.2302],[-7.51,109.29],[-7.61,109.51],[-7.67,109.65],[-7.72,109.91],[-7.71,110.01],[-7.86,110.16],[-7.7956,110.3695]],\"progress\":0.36,\"vehicle\":{\"icon\":\"local_shipping\",\"label\":\"Truk D 8812 KL\",\"sub\":\"Berikutnya: Purwokerto 06.30\"}}],\"markers\":[{\"at\":[-6.9175,107.6191],\"kind\":\"origin\",\"label\":\"Bandung\",\"sub\":\"Dimuat 15 Nov, 21.00\"},{\"at\":[-7.3274,108.2207],\"kind\":\"stop\",\"done\":true,\"label\":\"Tasikmalaya\",\"sub\":\"Dilewati 16 Nov, 01.40\"},{\"at\":[-7.4245,109.2302],\"kind\":\"stop\",\"label\":\"Purwokerto\",\"sub\":\"Perkiraan 06.30\"},{\"at\":[-7.7956,110.3695],\"kind\":\"destination\",\"label\":\"Yogyakarta\",\"sub\":\"Perkiraan 10.15\"}]}'></div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Beberapa tempat, dipaskan",
        "desc": "Tanpa rute, peta memaskan semua marker dengan ruang untuk pinnya. Di dalam halaman yang bergulir, `scrollZoom: \"modifier\"` menyerahkan roda mouse ke halaman dan hanya memperbesar bila Ctrl atau Cmd ditahan, dengan petunjuk singkat.",
        "html": "<div class=\"map\" style=\"--map-h: 300px; max-width: 560px;\" data-lds-map='{\"label\":\"Lokasi ujian di Bandung\",\"scrollZoom\":\"modifier\",\"markers\":[{\"at\":[-6.8915,107.6107],\"label\":\"Lokasi Dago\",\"sub\":\"120 kursi, sisa 2 sesi\"},{\"at\":[-6.9147,107.6098],\"label\":\"Lokasi Braga\",\"sub\":\"80 kursi, penuh\"},{\"at\":[-6.9389,107.6229],\"label\":\"Lokasi Buah Batu\",\"sub\":\"96 kursi, sisa 5 sesi\"},{\"at\":[-6.8721,107.5841],\"label\":\"Lokasi Setiabudi\",\"sub\":\"60 kursi, sisa 1 sesi\"},{\"at\":[-6.9447,107.5774],\"label\":\"Lokasi Kopo\",\"sub\":\"140 kursi, sisa 8 sesi\"}]}'></div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Berganti catatan: terbang untuk memaskan",
        "desc": "Memanggil `drawMap` lagi pada elemen yang sama (atau `handle.update`) menerbangkan peta keluar dan masuk kembali untuk memaskan rute baru, lalu menggambar bagian yang sudah ditempuh. Seret atau tombol apa pun menghentikan penerbangan di tempatnya.",
        "html": "<div class=\"docs-col\" style=\"gap: 12px;\"><div class=\"cluster\" style=\"--gap: 8px;\"><button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--sm\" type=\"button\" onclick=\"this.closest('.docs-col').querySelector('.map')._ldsMap.handle.update({&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Kargo udara dari Jakarta ke Singapura, 65 persen perjalanan&quot;,&quot;routes&quot;:[{&quot;path&quot;:[[-6.1256,106.6559],[1.3644,103.9915]],&quot;progress&quot;:0.65,&quot;arc&quot;:true,&quot;vehicle&quot;:{&quot;icon&quot;:&quot;flight&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Penerbangan 884&quot;,&quot;sub&quot;:&quot;Mendarat 08.45&quot;}}],&quot;markers&quot;:[{&quot;at&quot;:[-6.1256,106.6559],&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;origin&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Jakarta CGK&quot;,&quot;sub&quot;:&quot;Berangkat 06.10&quot;},{&quot;at&quot;:[1.3644,103.9915],&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;destination&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Singapura SIN&quot;,&quot;sub&quot;:&quot;Mendarat 08.45&quot;}]})\">Jakarta ke Singapura</button><button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--sm\" type=\"button\" onclick=\"this.closest('.docs-col').querySelector('.map')._ldsMap.handle.update({&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Angkutan darat dari Bandung ke Yogyakarta, sudah melewati Tasikmalaya, pemberhentian berikutnya Purwokerto&quot;,&quot;routes&quot;:[{&quot;path&quot;:[[-6.9175,107.6191],[-6.94,107.75],[-7.03,107.89],[-7.06,108.08],[-7.3274,108.2207],[-7.33,108.35],[-7.37,108.54],[-7.3,108.76],[-7.52,109.06],[-7.4245,109.2302],[-7.51,109.29],[-7.61,109.51],[-7.67,109.65],[-7.72,109.91],[-7.71,110.01],[-7.86,110.16],[-7.7956,110.3695]],&quot;progress&quot;:0.36,&quot;vehicle&quot;:{&quot;icon&quot;:&quot;local_shipping&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Truk D 8812 KL&quot;,&quot;sub&quot;:&quot;Berikutnya: Purwokerto 06.30&quot;}}],&quot;markers&quot;:[{&quot;at&quot;:[-6.9175,107.6191],&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;origin&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Bandung&quot;,&quot;sub&quot;:&quot;Dimuat 15 Nov, 21.00&quot;},{&quot;at&quot;:[-7.3274,108.2207],&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;stop&quot;,&quot;done&quot;:true,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Tasikmalaya&quot;,&quot;sub&quot;:&quot;Dilewati 16 Nov, 01.40&quot;},{&quot;at&quot;:[-7.4245,109.2302],&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;stop&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Purwokerto&quot;,&quot;sub&quot;:&quot;Perkiraan 06.30&quot;},{&quot;at&quot;:[-7.7956,110.3695],&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;destination&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Yogyakarta&quot;,&quot;sub&quot;:&quot;Perkiraan 10.15&quot;}]})\">Bandung ke Yogyakarta</button></div><div class=\"map\" style=\"--map-h: 320px;\" data-lds-map='{\"label\":\"Kargo udara dari Jakarta ke Singapura, 65 persen perjalanan\",\"routes\":[{\"path\":[[-6.1256,106.6559],[1.3644,103.9915]],\"progress\":0.65,\"arc\":true,\"vehicle\":{\"icon\":\"flight\",\"label\":\"Penerbangan 884\",\"sub\":\"Mendarat 08.45\"}}],\"markers\":[{\"at\":[-6.1256,106.6559],\"kind\":\"origin\",\"label\":\"Jakarta CGK\",\"sub\":\"Berangkat 06.10\"},{\"at\":[1.3644,103.9915],\"kind\":\"destination\",\"label\":\"Singapura SIN\",\"sub\":\"Mendarat 08.45\"}]}'></div></div>",
        "code": "<div class=\"map\" style=\"--map-h: 320px;\" data-lds-map='{\"label\":\"Kargo udara dari Jakarta ke Singapura\",\"routes\":[{\"path\":[[-6.1256,106.6559],[1.3644,103.9915]],\"progress\":0.65,\"arc\":true,\"vehicle\":{\"icon\":\"flight\",\"label\":\"Penerbangan 884\"}}],\"markers\":[{\"at\":[-6.1256,106.6559],\"kind\":\"origin\",\"label\":\"Jakarta CGK\"},{\"at\":[1.3644,103.9915],\"kind\":\"destination\",\"label\":\"Singapura SIN\"}]}'></div>\n\n<script type=\"module\">\n  import { drawMap } from 'lampung-design-system/js';\n  const map = drawMap(el, config);          // or let init() read data-lds-map\n  list.addEventListener('click', (e) => {\n    const s = shipments[e.target.closest('[data-id]').dataset.id];\n    map.update({ label: s.label, routes: s.routes, markers: s.markers });   // flies to fit\n  });\n  el.addEventListener('lds:mapselect', (e) => openShipment(e.detail.id));   // a marker was clicked\n</script>"
      }
